Package: metMatchAudit
Title: Audit Cross-Dataset Metabolite Matches with Structural Evidence
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R:
    person("Amin", "Ghasemi", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "your.email@example.com")
Description: Takes metabolite rows that a matching step (such as MetLinkR)
    has grouped across datasets and reports how each pair of rows relates:
    same compound, broader and narrower annotation, stereo variant,
    different compounds, or unresolved. Every result is traced to the
    rule and the evidence behind it. Lipid rows are placed in the
    SwissLipids hierarchy and parsed with rgoslin so that names from
    different vendors can be compared at the same level.
